<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 TAS Arum</book>
  <para style="h">2 TASALONIKAWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Tasalonikawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tasalonikawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Amgbasho Ablusu Ata afri ŋoh A na Na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tasalonikawa Mboh</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na Ablusu, tasa Sila, tasa Timoti, a na na duma amboh tufa Yeso ma Tasalonika, ata nza a bu ata Nnoh tasa ata Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Lisa alindeh tasa tuma alindeh anyi na Nnoh Ada tasa Ada Yeso kristi a ba na amohnoh.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwende tasa Kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />A zohhoh meh ti kwende ma Nnoh na tutu kanga tsifa amohnoh, atsi mya mboh, a zohhoh dehreh, nga agohsoh amohnoh ka buti rya tohmoh gaga, tasa kira ata nza ni kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh a buti rya tohmoh. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Nza ka a bu dehreh Mbohroh na ikpi ambohroh meh leh rya itoh na amohnoh amboh tufa Nnoh mboh, tsifa nza ni de noh ikpi ahroh, tasa nga agohsoh amohnoh nimeh wa iya abibi, tasa iya ata nza ni bu noh nimeh reh.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Amboh areh a tsana la hwra akpi Nnoh reh a bu yehlehleh, ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh, ni nati tswa ti bu noh nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh reh, a bu ma ikpi wohroh nza ni leh wa nnoh reh. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Nnoh reh a bu yehlehleh ma, nza ka a bu dehreh amboh ata nza ma a leh a nga noh iya reh, a nati a nga mboh iya za, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />tasa mohnoh amboh ata nza ni leh wa nnoh iya za a nati a nga noh fo, tasa Mbohroh za, ata areh a nati a bu ma ibi ata Ada Yeso nza a nati a ba anyi ma inza mboh ma agbugba mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh nimeh arimi shira. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />A nati ahwra akpi ma amboh ata nza ma a leke wina Nnoh, tasa amboh ata maka a leke tufa tsifa nana Ada Nnoh Yeso. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Ma a nati a wa iya ata tuma atono, tswanza Nnoh nza a nati a lofo mboh reh, a nati a katsi mboh anyi ma tohmoh Nnoh, ma a nati a nza Nnoh kpeh ha wuwana a ŋoh nza a bu agba reh kpeh. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Ibi wohroh reh a nati a ba, la amboh ata nza ma a bu na zanana reh mata a nga ŋoh agba, amboh nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh na a ŋoh reh maka a shi a ŋara aniye na a ŋoh, ata areh a mishi nnoh nambri, tsifa la ni kira nnoh na tsifa ambohroh nza meh bleh na aniye ambohroh reh.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nza a bu dehreh, mbohroh meh leh kwere Nnoh na tutu ma ikpi amohnoh la Nnoh ambohroh ta a bleh noh la ni tswa nnoh nimeh fi a ŋoh reh. Tasa za la nimeh wuwana a ŋoh, kohnoh awumu alilehndeh amohnoh reh ta a su, tasa ndohmoh ata nza a kate anyi ma aki nga agohsoh amohnoh reh. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Meh kwere Nnoh la ma aki wohroh, ma a nati a nga agba ma sa Ada ambohroh Yeso nimeh amohnoh, mohnoh za ma a nati a nga noh agba, la ni bu noh Yeso a ŋoh, a bu dehreh nambri la mohnoh ni bu ata Nnoh a ŋoh tasa ata ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Sene Tsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ma ikpi tsifa ba Yeso kristi ambohroh reh tasa tsifa ata meh nati dohsohna na a ŋoh reh, meh bleh noh atsi mya mboh, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />agohsoh amohnoh ta a kama a hwa ha ta a nyiri ma ikpi tsifa Nnoh mboh nza ma a hehndeh a bleh ha ma amgbasho, la anyi na ambohroh, la ibi Nnoh kǝ ba. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Kama kira nnoh akyo ta a landa nnoh kpeh, ibi wohroh a nati a hehreh a ba kpeh wuwa ikpi a nati a yama feh tasa kyangwri te agugu reh tana a kate feh, wohroh a bu kyangwri ata nza ma a lisa ŋoh a bana lofona reh. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Agugu reh a nati a nza kyangwri kpeh ma iyo tasa a nati a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka a keh mgbiri awumu mboh nza ma a fi la nnoh ha ata kyangwri nza ma ariri ŋoh, tasa za ta a gu ikpi a ŋoh a gya ma ida Nnoh, ta ka a bleh la ŋoh a bu Nnoh.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ni sohroh kohnoh nnoh la nza meh ti kǝ bu na amohnoh meh bleh noh awumu amboh areh kpeh? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Tasa ni wina noh andromboh ata nza a ka a ha ŋoh a gya reh, la ta a ka a te na ameh ata nza a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Tsifa ayuhu ata te Agugu reh kǝ bu nimeh ndohmoh, ŋoh ata nza a leh a ha reh, a nati a leh a ha a nina, la Nnoh tana a gu ŋoh a hinga ma aki feh. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ma a nati a tsana kyangwri ata ka a te agugu reh a kate, ameh ata neh Ada Yeso nza a nati a ba reh, a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo na huru inyo aniye a ŋoh tasa a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo na ba a ŋoh nimeh agba a ŋoh. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Ma a nati a nza iba ŋoh ata ka a te inyi reh anyi na wuwana ata agugu ka a lisa agbugba ndohmoh ŋara aniye reh, tasa ata kpra ndohmoh nga nyiri ata huru tsifa reh, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />tasa za a bu na landa abibi ta a landa amboh ata nza ma a bu ma aki a nati a lofona reh. Ma a nati a lofona tsifa ata nza ma a leke mata kira na tsifa a zizi mata a hunji nvara. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ma ikpi wohroh ŋa Nnoh ka a nati a tohmoh mboh na chakafana la mata a sa huru tsifa a kira, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />tasa la mata nga amboh nza ma a leke mata a sa tsifa a zizi a kira reh iya, neh ma ta ka a nza nana te ndohmoh agugu.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shi Wuwana Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Mbohroh meh nati kǝ kwende ma Nnoh na tutu kanga, ambohroh mboh ata Ada nza a kira na amohnoh reh, Ada reh a jiji a seh nnoh la ti hunji noh nvara ma aki ata nza ma a hwara nnoh na huru tasa nga agohsoh nimeh a zizi kira. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Nnoh a fi noh ma aki tsifa nana ata mbohroh nza meh hwra bleh noh reh, a fi noh la ti hunji noh agba ata nza a bu nimeh Ada Yeso Kristi reh. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Nza a bu dehreh neh atsi mya mboh, shi nnoh na wuwana tasa te de noh tsifa ata nza meh tsana noh reh, ha a bu na tsifa aniye ha ma amgbasho.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Meh kwere la, Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi na ikpi a ŋoh, tasa Nnoh Ada ambohroh, ata nza kira na ambohroh reh, nga reh wuwa agohsoh ata tuma atono, tasa gya agohsoh alindeh ma aki lisa alindeh a ŋoh. <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />Nga noh itoh amohnoh wuwana tasa ti nga nnoh wuwa agohsoh nimeh ndohmoh alindeh tasa tsifa.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Meh Luhu Kwere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ma trina ŋoh, atsi mya mboh, kwere turoh Nnoh la tohmoh ada reh ma a nati ahwra a bleh a treh atsifi na gbugbo tasa mata nga ŋoh agba, tswanza ta ka a bu na amohnoh reh. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Tasa kwere nnoh Nnoh la mata a sa reh a hwana anyi na amboh agugu mboh, a sohroh a bu kyangwri mboh nambri ŋa ma a bu na nga agohsoh kpeh. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Nnoh neh a bu yehlehleh, a nati a shwa nnoh tasa ta nga noh wuwana anyi na ata nza a bu agugu. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Mbohroh meh kira na ada ma ikpi amohnoh la ni bu noh nimeh lisa tasa za la nnoh nati rya nnoh tohmoh na lisa andromboh ata mbohroh nza meh tsana noh reh. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Meh kwere ada ta a tsana noh ma agohsoh amohnoh nimeh kira Nnoh tasa wuwa agohsoh ata kristi.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpi Ashotoh Ma Ikpi Yangru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Nimeh isa Yeso kristi, mbohroh meh bleh noh ambohroh mboh ti kama dohsoh noh ikpi na atsi ata nza a bu yangru ma tasa ka a sohroh a sa tsifa ata nza ni sa nyi nnoh na ambohroh reh a kira kpeh. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni wina noh ha a bu lele nza a tswa mohnoh te nza nyi nnoh na ambohroh reh. mbohroh timi sohroh te yangru meh ti kǝ bu amohnoh reh kpeh, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />ha meh ti rya awumu rya akyo meh ti sohroh fanga kpeh. Meh ti te ndohmoh a wa shini, meh leh te iya leh te ndohmoh la meh ti kama de anyi amohnoh te iya kpeh <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Meh lisa dehreh, a sohroh a bu la mata a shingi reh a bu abibi kpeh, meh lisa dehreh neh la mohnoh za ti nza nyi nnoh na ambohroh. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Mbohroh meh ti kǝ bu na amohnoh reh, meh kpi nnoh ashotoh la: &lt;&lt;Nza akyo ata nza a leke ta a te ndohmoh, mata a kama nga ŋoh rya kpeh. <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Mbohroh meh sehreh la amboh anyi nimeh amohnoh ma a bu yangru ma. Ma a ka a sohroh a te ndohmoh kpeh; maka a hehndeh a soh aniye ma tsifa ata nza a bu amoh kpeh. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Kyangwri amboh wohroh mbohroh meh kpi nnoh ashotoh nimeh isa ada Yeso kristi la mata a te ndohmoh mata a hunji awumu rya mata a rya. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />mohnoh atsi mya mboh neh, kama kuhwo nnoh atsi lisa andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh kpeh.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Akyo ata nza a sohroh a sa tsifa ambohroh nimeh amgbasho areh a kira kpeh, lisa nza noh. Kama dohsoh noh ikpi na a ŋoh kpeh, la ta a te ŋoh na abibi. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Dehreh neh kama gu mboh nnoh tswanza akyo ata nza a fi noh ma tomo kpeh, mohnoh neh ti kpi nnoh ashotoh tswanza a bu atsi ambohroh reh.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Ata Trina ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Meh kwere Ada ata nza a bu na nana agohsoh ta nga noh tuma alindeh na tutu tasa nimeh akeki mboh nambri. Ada ta a bu na amohnoh nambri. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Mya, Ablusu, meh ŋa amgbasho ata areh na ivoh amya tsifa na amohnoh, ata areh a bu kpra amya nza a bu tse nimeh amgbasho amya mboh reh nambri. A bu dehreh meh kǝ ŋa. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Lisa alindeh ata ada ambohroh Yeso kristi ta a bu na amohnoh nambri na tutu.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>